OL,3,ADrumcree stalemate continues as
OL,4,Aprotesters remain overnight
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrangemen also maintained a presence at
OL,7,FDrumcree church overnight, but were
OL,8,Fsmaller in number than previous nights.
